# Core Framework
# fastapi and redis are pinned to the versions `backend/requirements.txt`
# locks. Both drifted when CI resolved them unpinned: fastapi >= 0.137 defers
# route materialization behind `_IncludedRouter`, so `app.routes` stops
# exposing concrete routes, and redis >= 8 negotiates RESP3 on connect, which
# the Redis protocol fakes in the test suite do not speak.
